  "bodyHash": "65913a687915b79a",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">摘要</span></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;這最初是一個為朋友們設計的整合包，但在花費了許多時間製作後，我決定將其公開，讓更多人能享受更優質的 OneBlock 體驗！</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">歡迎隨時分享您的<span style=\"color:#169179\">建議</span>，或回報您發現的<span style=\"color:#169179\">錯誤</span>與<span style=\"color:#169179\">瑕疵</span><span style=\"color:#169179\">！</span><br></span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span>在<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">更新</span>整合包之前，請務必<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">備份<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您</span>的世界檔案</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">！！！</span><br></span></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本整合包基於原版 OneBlock 模組，玩家會在單一草方塊上生成，並必須擊碎它才能進入下一個階段以解鎖更多方塊。其中包含<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">0</span></strong>個結構類模組，這使得整合包的更新變得非常輕鬆。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">效能</span></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">它應該會是</span>&nbsp;<strong>有史以來效能最佳的整合包！</strong>內建超過<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">45 款效能優化模組</span>，整個遊戲<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">僅從 One Block 開始</span>，其他模組皆為小型擴充套件與函式庫，其中最龐大的模組目前為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a>。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">常見問題</span></strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">Q：「如何建立新世界？」</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>A：目前您必須使用位於「建立新世界」按鈕下方的「重新建立」功能，此功能僅適用於第一個「OneBlock」（非「Original」）世界。</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">Q：「無限耐久度？」</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>關閉方法：開啟您的 mods 資料夾並刪除「What Durability?」模組</p>\n<p>原因：耐久度系統往往變得繁瑣且缺乏意義，尤其是大多數玩家最終都會使用修補術（Mending），這使得耐久度變得無關緊要。此外，此模組能讓金製工具變得實用！</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">Q：「恐怖模組？」</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>A：該「恐怖」模組名稱為「Distant Friends」。它只會生成一些遠處的實體，主要使用全黑貼圖。當您直視它們時，這些身影會有反應，並在您靠近時消失。</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frazvangn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_b209548d-33c6-4553-b2f4-4b01b2e64f44.png\" width=\"476\" height=\"80\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/AeuBs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1090118/description_4b9c9228-1223-419b-92e7-756819aad08f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"></a></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">規劃中功能：</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>以下模組可能會根據相容性、功能與需求加入或不加入：<br><br>更多獨特相關的進度。<br>原版物品的自訂合成配方。<br>防止生物破壞地形。</em></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cursery</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblegen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleGen</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sneaky Curses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-tabs-updated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tabs</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vectorientation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vectorientation</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mobtimizations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobtimizations</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-snow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Snow</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smooth-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Particles</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fluid-void-fading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fluid Void Fading</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/whats-that-slot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">What's That Slot?</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-crosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Crosshair</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beneath-the-wetlands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beneath the Wetlands</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backported-spears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backported Spears</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Portals</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Furniture</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fxs-rail-optimization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FX's Rail Optimization</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coffeegs-awful-lightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoffeeG's Awful Lightning!</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> vs <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Handcrafted</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-progressive-bosses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressive Bosses</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillatweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VanillaTweaks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/odds-ends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odds &amp; Ends</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-fixes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carpet-Fixes</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblin-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Goblin Traders</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Starlight</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold my Items</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreCulling</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blanket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blanket</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/newdefaultplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Default+</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/everything-animated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Everything Animated!</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky OneBlock - Lucky Blocks</a></p>",
